{"steam_appid":2101390,"steam_name":"Lost and Found Co.","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2101390/1133179432/2deea9a95a70ee427035a4aa9b6993285a315eda/1782300774/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1782301675","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257364787/f5c9e7f6d8967d784a221e301e61e368d3fb2c69/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1782301675","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/14a7addd31033bfe9721f674f2ce1ed4149648d7/ss_14a7addd31033bfe9721f674f2ce1ed4149648d7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786614622","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/ss_7b1bed18ea0ea8baa876acec79e0743964e2c8c2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786614622","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/ss_6bee5a772a4c48517709b835c143fd096ddb781e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786614622","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/a76cccef23e914c83827100a43a1fb0274051cfa/ss_a76cccef23e914c83827100a43a1fb0274051cfa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786614622","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/dc386de2a4534d1f2310ccdbf73896b6a81112db/ss_dc386de2a4534d1f2310ccdbf73896b6a81112db.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786614622"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/a4ba9e44e7e738045546cf45df25634c.avif?t=1786614622\" width=780 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/3bd66383b83ed406ee393ca95c57a766.poster.avif?t=1786614622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/3bd66383b83ed406ee393ca95c57a766.webm?t=1786614622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/3bd66383b83ed406ee393ca95c57a766.mp4?t=1786614622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost and Found Co.</strong> is a whimsical hidden object game where you help Ducky, a duck-turned-human intern, at Goddess Mei’s company - a magical startup dedicated to finding lost items for its quirky townspeople.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/d5d35fd146a4b2c0c07599ca975a0211.avif?t=1786614622\" width=780 height=170 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✨ Hunt for well-hidden items in engaging challenge levels!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your object-hunting skills to the test on these fun, challenging levels, delivering pure hidden-object gameplay goodness. Endless fun awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/bf7a4a082c55e1d1e8139f5ddf152a1d.poster.avif?t=1786614622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/bf7a4a082c55e1d1e8139f5ddf152a1d.webm?t=1786614622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/bf7a4a082c55e1d1e8139f5ddf152a1d.mp4?t=1786614622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌿 Experience the breathtaking locales!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through charming locales that bring your childhood puzzle books to life in a heartwarming and whimsical world filled with a bunch of items to discover, offering a joyful escape for players of all ages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/389a7ae0b7ffaf82452f6cce7e1f5eb5.poster.avif?t=1786614622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/389a7ae0b7ffaf82452f6cce7e1f5eb5.webm?t=1786614622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/389a7ae0b7ffaf82452f6cce7e1f5eb5.mp4?t=1786614622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💭 Find out the goings-on in this wholesome place!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return lost items to their rightful owners in this adorable world, filled with thousands of interactive objects and characters, all with their own intriguing stories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/d1121f32c4212991d8e32832b794dbdc.poster.avif?t=1786614622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/d1121f32c4212991d8e32832b794dbdc.webm?t=1786614622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/d1121f32c4212991d8e32832b794dbdc.mp4?t=1786614622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>📦 Decorate Ducky’s Room!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate Ducky’s bedroom using tons of cute assets available in a robust and easy-to-use room editor. Cute? Gothic? Goofy? Express your creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/475a2b7c233f38bd9f0b0bff8615ebcf.poster.avif?t=1786614622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/475a2b7c233f38bd9f0b0bff8615ebcf.webm?t=1786614622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/475a2b7c233f38bd9f0b0bff8615ebcf.mp4?t=1786614622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/abbaefe7655d4b32b76961350984a213.avif?t=1786614622\" width=780 height=170 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player hidden object story campaign 🔎</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus challenge levels testing your keen eyes 👀</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highly interactive levels where you can click on anything! 👆</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Renovate your office and customize Ducky’s Room 📦</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover easter eggs and surprises hidden in this magical world!!! 🌈</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/24b224cfa835bd655482f7c6d53a4c6c.poster.avif?t=1786614622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/24b224cfa835bd655482f7c6d53a4c6c.webm?t=1786614622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/24b224cfa835bd655482f7c6d53a4c6c.mp4?t=1786614622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Requires GPU with 1GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 750 Ti / Radeon R7 250<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie"],"developers":["Bit Egg Inc."],"publishers":["Bit Egg Inc.","Gamirror Games"],"release_date":"5 Mar, 2026","metacritic_score":90}